<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3171] Restart of interpreter in note also aborts running interpreter in another note</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3171</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Howtoreproducebug&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;How to reproduce bug&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Set python interpreter in isolated mode per user/per note&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create two notes with python interpreter.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Insert code in paragraph
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-python&quot;&gt;
%python
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; time

&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Hello&apos;&lt;/span&gt;)
time.sleep(300)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run all notes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Restart python interpreter in note1&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Get &apos;KeyboardInterrupt: &apos; in note2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The same error will be if run note1 and restart python in note2.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt;, please help&lt;/p&gt;</description>
